==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|вѣсть||ru-PRO}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-весть.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-весть.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}

===Etymology 1===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*weyd-}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*věstь}}.

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|e|ве́сть|f|dim=ве́сточка}}

# [[news]], piece of news, message; [[tidings]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[пропа́сть]] [[бе́з]] '''вести'''|to go missing (without a trace / unaccounted for)}}
#: {{uxi|ru|Ма́рко [[отовсю́ду]] [[нести|несёт]] ему́ '''весте́й'''.|t=Marco brings him '''news''' from everywhere.}}
# {{lb|ru|in the plural}} [[news]] {{gloss|presentation of news, e.g. on television}}

=====Declension=====
{{ru-noun-table|e|ве́сть|f}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|ru|ве́стовой|g=m-an}}
* {{l|ru|ве́сточка|g=f}}
* {{l|ru|изве́стие|g=n}}

